new type of heartwarming anime that might even be the new definition of kawaii!?\n\n\n\nIn a city somewhere in Japan, there's a flyer often seen on Third Street with a picture of a cat with a kinked tail, bearing the words: “Have you seen Tama?” A young boy gazes at the flyer, but he has fluffy ears on his head…!? Watch the dogs and cats from Third Street take on a human form and get up to some mischief.\n\n\n\nTake a peek into the wonderful lives of Tama and his friends.\n\n\n\n(Source: Aniplex of America)"],"ja":["うちタマ?!~うちのタマ知りませんか?~",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-20922":"2020-11-15T15:36:42Z","serial-23608":"2020-10-14T15:28:53Z","serial-21381":"2020-06-21T21:16:24Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-20922","serial-23608","serial-21381"],"relatedMalIds":[],"availableEpisodeCount":11,"rating":6.95}]}